# Roadmap_Scaling.md A6 — secrets and dev-only cruft must never enter the build context,
# let alone the shipped image. .env is the one that actually matters (a real leak risk if
# baked into an image pushed to ECR) but everything below is genuine bloat/noise too.
.env
.env.example
.git
.gitignore
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
tests/
frontend/
venv/
.venv/
*.md
CLAUDE.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
